{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/6/236ef05afc2894a6070b2dac00fdf4b0fafd087a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-4y^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d3638ebb4354ff5f32950553842a34e665851159.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{a parabola} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{an ellipse} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{a pair of straight lines}\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{a point}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"761\" height=\"18\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4013c05146d33acda9166707992f9158bda3de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 4y^2 = (x - 2y)(x+2y) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"256\" height=\"21\" />, so this graph consists of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> such that either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/d/b3d95de90a02857257634784ee0104d605b03734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/047988b0ac8b2845996c5da1d6bb069c8b6b1431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, the graph is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d60c736b345bcdd31d0d46d59231620dab7f5662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{a pair of straight lines}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"208\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"